ur waiter skills to earn more tips and invest them in upgrades, and don\u2019t forget to pay the rent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Are you ready to make your way as a waiter in the mysterious world of Japanese spirits? Keep your balance, solve puzzles and find your way home!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3373830/extras/wishlist_now.gif?t=1741081013\" /></p>","developers":["Who is Terry?"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3373830/header.jpg?t=1741081013","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257101628,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257101628/movie480.mp4?t=1741069333","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257101628/movie_max.mp4?t=1741069333"},"name":"Announcement Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257101628/750af2b81464424ff3be1e4dd86627bdea0790db/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1741069333","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257101628/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1741069333","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257101628/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1741069333"}}],"name":"The Way of the Tray: Japanese Restaurant Simulator \ud83c\udf59","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows XP SP3<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.0 Ghz Intel Pentium-4 / AMD Athlon II<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 256 MB NVidia / AMD Radeon / Intel (HD 3000, HD 4000) with support for Pixel Shader 3.0 (AMD Radeon X1000 not supported)<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>",